      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "k6 Client E2E (test-cycle.sh)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Client-side **end-to-end** metrics from the k6 load generator (`experimental-prometheus-rw`). Measures full HTTP round-trip: connect \u2192 send \u2192 **wait (TTFB)** \u2192 receive. Enabled by default in `test-cycle.sh`; filter by **testid** tag. Server-side ledger metrics: [Ledger Overview](/d/ledger-overview). Refresh: 5s."
      }
    },
